@startuml
title Rust Sudoku Solver – Crate Module Structure

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

' =========================================================
' CRATE ROOT
' =========================================================

package "crate root (lib.rs)" {

component "lib.rs" as ROOT

note right of ROOT
Entry point of the Rust crate.

Defines internal modules:
- ffi
- process_data
- store_data

Re-exports the public API:
pub use ffi::*;
end note

}

' =========================================================
' MODULES
' =========================================================

package "Internal Modules" {

component "ffi.rs\n(FFI interface)" as FFI

component "process_data.rs\n(Sudoku solver logic)" as PROCESS

component "store_data.rs\n(JSON persistence)" as STORE

}

' =========================================================
' RELATIONSHIPS
' =========================================================

ROOT --> FFI : mod
ROOT --> PROCESS : mod
ROOT --> STORE : mod

FFI --> PROCESS : uses
FFI --> STORE : uses

note right of FFI
Provides C-compatible API
for Dart/Flutter via FFI.

Functions:
- create_matrix
- update_cell
- update_matrix
- erase_matrix
- set_all_candidates
- free_matrix
end note

note right of PROCESS
Sudoku solving logic:
- check_one_element()
- check_all_elements()
end note

note right of STORE
Handles persistence:
- load matrix
- save matrix
- JSON serialization
end note

' =========================================================
' EXTERNAL BOUNDARY
' =========================================================

actor "Dart / Flutter App" as DART

DART --> FFI : FFI calls

@enduml
